  "@type": "DefinedTerm",
  "alternateName": "Population abundance not affected adversely by anthropogenic pressures",
  "description": "The population abundance of the species\nis not adversely affected due to anthropogenic pressures, such that its long-term\nviability is ensured.\nMember States shall establish threshold\nvalues for each species through regional\nor subregional cooperation, taking account of natural variation in population\nsize and the mortality rates derived from\nD1C1, D8C4 and D10C4 and other relevant pressures. For species covered by\nDirective 92/43/EEC, these values shall be\nconsistent with the Favourable Reference\nPopulation values established by the relevant Member States under Directive\n92/43/EEC.",
  "disambiguatingDescription": "This term was created by MBO WP1 task 1.3 with external domain experts during the MARCO-BOLO Project to express that this object is of relevance to the named criterion of the MFSD",
